<title>USA: J.C. Penney's Eckerd to buy 114 Revco stores.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney's Eckerd to buy 114 Revco stores.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eckerd Corp, a unit of J.C. Penney Co Inc, said Friday that it has agreed to acquire 114 Virginia-based Revco D.S. Inc drug stores from CVS Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Eckerd's stores will total more than 2,800 stores with the acquisition, the company said. The Revco stores that CVS is selling are part of Revco D.S. Inc's chain, which CVS is acquiring.</p>
</text>
